=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  keys weak ----------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. george's laptop key is root's too;$
# his RSA 1024 key and alice's DSA key are weak, and sshd$
# refuses DSA. His RSA 2048 key is not marked: the rule drawn is$
# under 2048.$
$
# SSH Keys #####################################################$
$
  Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Keys                 6 in 3 accounts$
  [ ] Weak                 2 keys$
  [ ] Shared               1 key$
   -  Refused by sshd      1 key$
$
  root ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] ED25519              george@laptop-1 Shared with george$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] ED25519              george@laptop-1 Shared with root$
  [ ] RSA 1024             george@old-laptop Weak$
   -  RSA 2048             george@desk-1$
$
  alice --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] DSA                  alice@2009 Weak, refused by sshd$
   -  ECDSA 384            alice@laptop-2$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

